# Root build context — used by BOTH the single-service ./Dockerfile (Coolify; copies
# frontend/ + backend/ + contracts/ + seed-data.json) and compose's api image
# (./backend/Dockerfile). Never ship deps, build output, secrets or live data.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
data
backend/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
backups
uploads
certbot-www
coverage
*.log
.git
.github
.vscode
docs
